{
  "Package": "pdInfoBuilder",
  "Title": "Platform Design Information Package Builder",
  "Description": "Builds platform design information packages. These consist\nof a SQLite database containing feature-level data such as x, y\nposition on chip and featureSet ID. The database also\nincorporates featureSet-level annotation data. The products of\nthis packages are used by the oligo pkg.",
